{"id":"n83566-1-7","stage":4,"title":"푸념 · 牢骚 ","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83566-1-7-1","ko":"그 노인의 푸념에 한숨도 못 잤다니깐.","zh":"那个老人一直发牢骚，害得我一点儿觉都没睡。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"노인의","meaning":"老人，老年人","explanation":"노인：老人，老年人；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"노인","audio":"/audio/3b01f8c362012e852a8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63641","senseId":"1","lemma":"노인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노인의","audio":"/audio/5a37d2f1d2f1104d7462.mp3"}},{"text":"푸념에","meaning":"牢骚 ，抱怨 ，埋怨 ，闲话","explanation":"푸념：牢骚 ，抱怨 ，埋怨 ，闲话；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"푸념","audio":"/audio/d14385969084d74318ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83566","senseId":"1","lemma":"푸념","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"푸념에","audio":"/audio/f3b304e8c2a2241445c2.mp3"}},{"text":"한숨도","meaning":"一会儿，喘一口气的功夫","explanation":"한숨：一会儿，喘一口气的功夫；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"한숨","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85558","senseId":"1","lemma":"한숨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한숨도","audio":"/audio/87ab8c085dc74311b545.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"잤다니깐.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다니깐：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤다니깐","audio":"/audio/36459f02814722ca4667.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"3b01f8c362012e85","term":"노인","zh":"老人，老年人","audio":"/audio/3b01f8c362012e852a8b.mp3","entryId":"63641","definition":"上岁数而年迈的人。","pronunciation":["노ː인"]},{"id":"d14385969084d743","term":"푸념","zh":"牢骚 ，抱怨 ，埋怨 ，闲话","audio":"/audio/d14385969084d74318ac.mp3","entryId":"83566","definition":"说出心中的不满；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["푸념"]},{"id":"3518247f7283983b","term":"한숨","zh":"一会儿，喘一口气的功夫","audio":"/audio/3518247f7283983ba07d.mp3","entryId":"85558","definition":"指休息或睡觉的时间非常短暂。","pronunciation":["한숨"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1cc47330c46fafef0c8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83566-1-7-2","ko":"그래? 얼마나 너에게 많은 불평을 한 거야?","zh":"是吗？他到底对你抱怨了多少啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"너에게","meaning":