:"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"0d4a5f09be82a202","term":"불평","zh":"不满，牢骚","audio":"/audio/0d4a5f09be82a202836e.mp3","entryId":"24523","definition":"对某事或某人感到不中意；或将此种心情用语言表现出来。。","pronunciation":["불평"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/40516555cae78042ca3e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.949,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83566","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那个老人一直发牢骚，害得我一点儿觉都没睡。","是吗？他到底对你抱怨了多少啊？","我实在不知道该怎么跟智秀开口说话。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个老人一直发牢骚，害得我一点儿觉都没睡。","是吗？他到底对你抱怨了多少啊？","我实在不知道该怎么跟智秀开口说话。"],"answer":1}]}
